      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Arg! ¡Ya me ha vuelto a pasar!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007200670021002000A1005900610020006D00650020006800610020007600750065006C0074006F00200061002000700061007300610072002100100002011400040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Que alguien me saque de aquí!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Algún ataque Pokémon habrá que sea\nlo bastante fuerte para romper esta maraña!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alguien ha quedado atrapado en un saco de hilo\nde Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nUsa un movimiento Pokémon con suficiente\npotencia para romper el hilo y rescatarlo.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Usa un movimiento más fuerte, por favor!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi quieres comprobar la fuerza de un movimiento,\nabre el menú principal, selecciona al Pokémon<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ny elige \"Gestionar movimientos\".<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 180
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Uf, menos mal!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100550066002C0020006D0065006E006F00730020006D0061006C0021001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Me has salvado el pellejo! ¡Gracias por ayudarme!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D00650020006800610073002000730061006C007600610064006F00200065006C002000700065006C006C0065006A006F0021002000A1004700720061006300690061007300200070006F00720020006100790075006400610072006D00650021001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué te ha pasado?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E9002000740065002000680061002000700061007300610064006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quién te ha hecho eso?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00510075006900E9006E00200074006500200068006100200068006500630068006F002000650073006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ha sido cosa suya.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800610020007300690064006F00200063006F0073006100200073007500790061002E001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estos tres son mis Spinarak.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074006F00730020007400720065007300200073006F006E0020006D006900730020005300700069006E006100720061006B002E001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Siempre me hacen lo mismo cuando se enfadan.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690065006D0070007200650020006D006500200068006100630065006E0020006C006F0020006D00690073006D006F0020006300750061006E0064006F00200073006500200065006E0066006100640061006E002E001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Narak!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E006100720061006B00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He roto sin querer el nido que habían\nconstruido y no les ha sentado nada bien.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "De repente, tenía a los tres encima enredándome\nen su hilo.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPero ha sido solo un accidente, no era para\nponerse así...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Na, narak!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E0061002C0020006E006100720061006B00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vale, de acuerdo! ¡Lo siento de veras!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006C0065002C0020006400650020006100630075006500720064006F0021002000A1004C006F0020007300690065006E0074006F0020006400650020007600650072006100730021001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aunque... ya podríamos darle un mejor uso a todo\nese hilo que sois capaces de producir.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Podríamos montar un negocio de cuerdas\ny redes, y hacernos de oro!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 163
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vale, vale! ¡No he dicho nada! ¡No os enfadéis!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
